# Checked against lending.contract's release 2:
#   klein check --contract examples/lending.contract examples/lending-rule.klein --release 2
#
# Calls a capability by its plain name, so it type-checks but cannot yet be executed — capabilities
# are not wired up to a runtime handler (see TODO.md, "Capabilities reachable from Klein source"):
#   klein run --contract examples/lending.contract examples/lending-rule.klein --release 2

creditScore(customer) >= 620 and customer.tier == "gold"
